#tr.ts: u ḫiššatum mārat (ḫ)alikum
#tr.en: and Ḫiššatum daughter of Ḫalikum

9. a-na ta-ku-ma-tum 
#tr.ts: ana takū(m)mātum
#tr.en: against Takūmmātum

10. u3-ul e-ra-ga-mu 
#tr.ts: ul era(g)gamū
#tr.en: will not raise a claim,

11. _mu_ {d}utu u3 {d}marduk 
#tr.ts: nīš šamaš u marduk
