$ single ruling 
5. _igi_ dumu-{d}utu _dumu_ ia-ku-num2  
6. _igi_ {d}nanna-zi-mu _dumu_ i-di-szum 
7. _igi_ ha-ia-sza-rum _dumu_ ia-ah-s,u2-ur-dingir! 
8. _igi_ a-wi-il-dingir _dumu_ sin-ru-x-[...] 
