#tr.ts: kiam iqbû umma šūma
#tr.en: said the following:

9. _1(disz) gin2 ku3-babbar_ sza a-na i-t,i3-ib-li-ba-szu 
#tr.ts: išten šiqil kaspam ša ana iṭīb-li(b)bašu
#tr.en: "The one shekel of silver that to Iṭīb-libbašu

10. ap-qi2-du-ka 
