#tr.ts: mārū kasap-ilabrat aššum ištēn imērim biltim
#tr.en: sons of Kasap-ilabrat, because of the (lit. one) pack donkey,
7. i-na li-bi zimbir{ki} i-di-nu-ma da-ia-nu-<<um>> 
#tr.ts: ina li(b)bi sippar idīnūma dayyānū
#tr.en: have handed over in Sippar. The judges
8. i-na ba-ab {d}utu di-nam u2-sza-hi-zu-szu-nu-ti-ma 
#tr.ts: ina bāb šamaš dīnam ušāḫizūšunūtīma
#tr.en: at the Gate of Šamaš have granted them a trial and,
9. asz-szum _1(disz) ansze_ bi-il-tim sza dingir-szu-a-bu-szu _dumu_ {d}suen-na-s,ir 
#tr.ts: aššum ištēn imērim biltim ša ilšu-abūšu mār sîn-nāṣir
#tr.en: because of the (lit. one) pack donkey which Ilšu-abūšu son of Sîn-nāṣir
10. _ki_ ARAD-{d}en-lil2 u3 s,il2-li2-isz8-tar2 _szesz-a-ni dumu-mesz_ <ku3>-{d}nin-szubur 
#tr.ts: itti warad-enlil u ṣilli-ištar aḫīšu mārī kasap-ilabrat
#tr.en: from Warad-enlil and Ṣilli-ištar his brother sons of Kasap-ilabrat
11. i-gu-ru a-na szu-ri-nim sza {d}utu a-na <<i>> na-sa-hi-im 
#tr.ts: īgurū ana šuri(n)nim ša šamaš ana nasaḫim
#tr.en: had rented, (to take an oath) by pulling out the emblem of Šamaš,
12. da-ia-nu a-na dingir-szu-a-bu-szu {disz}ARAD-{d}en-lil2 id-di-nu-szu-ma 
#tr.ts: dayyānū ana ilšu-abūšu warad-enlil iddinūšūma
#tr.en: the judges have sent Warad-enlil to Ilšu-abūšu and
13. i-na szu-ri-nim sza {d}utu i-na ba-ab {d}utu la-bi-ru-u2-tim 
#tr.ts: ina šuri(n)nim ša šamaš ina bāb šamaš labirutim
#tr.en: before the emblem of Šamaš at the Old Gate of Šamaš,
14. {disz}dingir-szu-a-bu-szu _dumu_ {d}suen-na-s,ir {disz}ARAD-{d}en-lil2 u3 s,il2-li2-isz8-tar2 _szesz-a-ni_ 
#tr.ts: ilšu-abūšu mār sîn-nāṣir warad-enlil u ṣilli-ištar aḫūšu
#tr.en: Ilšu-abūšu son of Sîn-nāṣir, Warad-enlil and Ṣilli-ištar his brother
15. _dumu-mesz_ ku3-{d}nin-szubur im-ta-ag-ru-ma a-na _6(disz) gin2 ku3-babbar_ 
#tr.ts: mārū kasap-ilabrat imtagrūma ana šeššet šiqil kaspim
#tr.en: sons of Kasap-ilabrat have reached an agreement and for the 6 shekels of silver
16. <<sza>> i-na za-ab-ba-an{ki} u3 a-na _1(u) gin2 ku3-babbar_ i-na zimbir{ki} 
#tr.ts: ina zabban u ana ešret šiqil kaspim ina sippar
#tr.en: in Zabban and for the 10 shekels of silver in Sippar
17. sza ta-am-gi-<ir>-tim sza asz-szum _1(disz) ansze_ il-qu2-u2 
#tr.ts: ša tamgirtim ša aššum išten imērim ilqû
#tr.en: agreed-upon, which for the (lit. one) donkey they had took,
18. {disz}dingir-szu-a-bu-szu a-na ARAD-{d}en-lil2 u3 s,il2-li2-isz8-tar2 _szesz-a-ni_ 
#tr.ts: ilšu-abūšu ana warad-enlil u ṣilli-ištar aḫīšu
#tr.en: Ilšu-abūšu against Warad-enlil and Ṣilli-ištar his brother
19. u2-ul e-ra-ga-am _u4 kur2-sze3_ la i-tu-ru-u2-ma 
#tr.ts: ul era(g)gam ana warkiāt ūmī la itu(r)rūma
#tr.en: will not raise a claim. (That) in future, again
20. {disz}ARAD-{d}en-lil2 {disz}s,il2-li2-isz8-tar2 u3 dingir-szu-a-bu-szu asz-szum _1(disz) ansze_ 
#tr.ts: warad-enlil ṣilli-ištar u ilšu-abūšu aššum išten imērim
#tr.en: Warad-enlil, Ṣilli-ištar and Ilšu-abūšu, concerning the (lit. one) donkey,
21. a-hu-um a-na a-hi-im la e-ra-ga-mu _<mu>_ {d}utu {d}marduk 
#tr.ts: aḫum ana aḫim la era(g)gamū nīš šamaš marduk
#tr.en: one against the other will not sue, by the name of Šamaš, Marduk,
22. a-pil-{d}suen u3 _iri_ zimbir{ki} isz-ti-ni-isz it-mu 
#tr.ts: apil-sîn u āli sippar ištiniš itmû
#tr.en: Apil-sîn and the city of Sippar they have sworn together.
23. _igi_ u-<bar>-ru-um _dumu_ {d}suen-le-e-i _igi_ i-din-{d}ma-mu _dumu_ na-nu-um 
#tr.ts: maḫar ubarrum mār sîn-lē’î maḫar i(d)din-mamu mār nanum
#tr.en: Before Ubarrum son of Sîn-lē’î; before Iddin-mamu son of Nanum;
24. _igi_ i-din-nu-nu _dumu_ li-pi2-it-{d}en-lil2 _igi_ ak-sza-ia _dumu_ {d}utu-he2#-gal2# 
#tr.ts: maḫar i(d)din-nunu mār lipit-enlil maḫar akšaya mār šamaš-ḫengallum
#tr.en: before Iddin-nunu son of Lipit-enlil; before Akšaya son of Šamaš-ḫengallum;
25. _igi_ sza-i3-li2-szu _dumu_ {d}mar-tu-na-s,ir _igi_ {d}utu-dingir _dumu_ im-di-{d#}en#-lil2 
#tr.ts: maḫar ša-ilīšu mār amurru-nāṣir maḫar šamaš-ilī mār imdī-enlil
#tr.en: before Ša-ilīšu son of Amurru-nāṣir; before Šamaš-ilī son of Imdi-enlil;
26. _igi_ t,a3-ab-gi6-uri2{ki} _dumu_ ak-sza-ia _igi_ {d}utu-da-a-an _dumu_ {d}suen-ka-szi-id 
#tr.ts: maḫar ṭāb-akkadim mār akšaya maḫar šamaš-dan mār sîn-kašid
#tr.en: before Ṭāb-akkadim son of Akšaya; before Šamaš-dan son of Sîn-kašid;
27. _igi_ nu-ur2-{d}kab-ta _dumu_ im-gur-{d}suen 
#tr.ts: maḫar nūr-kabta mār imgur-sîn
#tr.en: before Nūr-kabta son of Imgur-sîn;
28. _igi_ {d}utu-na-s,ir _maszkim di-ku5_ 
#tr.ts: maḫar šamaš-nāṣir rābiṣ dayyānim
#tr.en: before Šamaš-nāṣir, judicial officer;
29. _igi_ i-din-{d}suen _dub-sar iti_ e-lu-nim _u4 5(disz)#-kam_ 
#tr.ts: maḫar i(d)din-sîn ṭupšarrim waraḫ elūnim ūmam ḫamšat
#tr.en: before Iddin-sîn, the scribe. The month of Elūnum, the day 5,
30. _mu_ a-pil-{d}suen _lugal-e bad3 du-ur-mu-ti{ki} ba-du3_ 
