#tr.en: her possessions, the content of this tablet,

28. sza be-le-su2-nu _dumu-munus_ pa-la-{d}iszkur a-hi-sza
#tr.ts: ša bēlessunu mārat palā-adad aḫīša
#tr.en: will belong to Bēlessunu daughter of Palā-adad her brother (and)

29. a-szar e-li-sza t,a3-bu
#tr.ts: ašar elīša ṭābu
#tr.en: wherever is acceptable to her

@reverse
1. ap-lu-sa3 i-na-ad-di-in
#tr.ts: aplu(s)sa inaddin
#tr.en: she will be able to give her legacy.

2. {disz}be-le-su2-nu _dumu-munus_ pa-la-{d}iszkur
#tr.ts: bēlessunu mārat palā-adad
#tr.en: (If) Bēlessunu daughter of Palā-adad

3. [a-na] inim#-{[d]}a-a a-ha-at a-bi-sza um-mi-sza
#tr.ts: ana awāt-ayya aḫat abīša ummīša
#tr.en: to Awāt-ayya her aunt, her (adoptive) mother,

4. [u2-ul um-mi at-ti i]-qa2-ab-bi-i-ma
#tr.ts: ul ummīya atti iqabbīma
#tr.en: says: "You are not my mother!",

5. [i-na ... i]-te-el-li u3 inim-{d}a-a
#tr.ts: ina ... ītelli u awāt-ayya
#tr.en: ... will forfeit, and (if) Awāt-ayya

6. [a-na be-le-su2-nu u2-ul mar-ti] at#!-ti i-qa2-ab-bi-ma
#tr.ts: ana bele(s)sunu ul mārtī atti iqabbīma
#tr.en: to Bēlessunu says: "you are not my daughter!",

7. [...] x a-di in-bi-ki _lukur#_ {d#}utu
#tr.ts: ... adi inbi-erṣetim nadīt šamaš
#tr.en: ... as long as Inbi-erṣetim nadītu of Šamaš

8. [ba-al-t,a-at _mu 1(disz)-kam n] gin2# ku3-babbar 6(disz) sila3 i3-gesz_
#tr.ts: balṭat ištēn šattim ... kaspam šeššet qa šamnam
#tr.en: is alive, every year ... silver, 6 litres of oil

9. [{disz}be-le-su2-nu _dumu-munus_] pa-la-{d}iszkur
#tr.ts: bēle(s)sunu mārat palā-adad
#tr.en: Bēlessunu daughter of Palā-adad

10. [i-na-ad]-di-isz-szi-im
#tr.ts: inaddiššim
#tr.en: will give her.

11. [_mu_ {d}utu {d}a-a] {d}marduk
#tr.ts: nīš šamaš ayya marduk
#tr.en: (By) the life of Šamaš, Ayya, Marduk

12. [u3 sa-am-su-i-lu-na] _lugal# in-pa3-de3-mesz_
#tr.ts: u samsu-iluna šarrim itmû
#tr.en: and Samsu-iluna the king, they have sworn.

13. [_igi_ ARAD-{d}suen] _sanga_ {d}utu
#tr.ts: maḫar warad-sîn šangêm šamaš
#tr.en: Before Warad-sîn, chief admninistrator of Šamaš(' temple);

14. [_igi_ sin-e-ri-ba-am] _sanga_ {d}utu
#tr.ts: maḫar sîn-erībam šangêm šamaš
#tr.en: before Sîn-erībam, chief admninistrator of Šamaš(' temple);

15. [_igi_ a-wi-il]-isz8-tar2 _dumu_ {d}nanna-tum
#tr.ts: maḫar awīl-ištar mār nannatum
#tr.en: before Awīl-ištar son of Nannatum;

16. [_igi_ sig-an-nu-ni]-tum! _dumu_ dingir-szu-ba-ni
#tr.ts: maḫar ipqu-annunītum mār ilšu-bānī
#tr.en: before Ipqu-annunītum son of Ilšu-bānī;

17. [_igi_ {d}marduk-ni]-szu _ugula lukur {d}utu-mesz_
#tr.ts: maḫar marduk-nīšu akil nadiāt šamaš
#tr.en: before Marduk-nīšu, overseer of Šamaš's nadītus;

18. [_igi_ ra-pa-asz]-s,il2-li2-e2-a _ugula lukur {d}utu-mesz_
#tr.ts: maḫar rapaš-ṣilli-ea akil nadiāt šamaš
#tr.en: before Rapaš-ṣilli-ea, overseer of Šamaš's nadītus;

19. [_igi_ a-wi]-il#-{d}iszkur _dub-sar lukur {d}utu-mesz_
#tr.ts: maḫar awīl-adad ṭupšar nadiāt šamaš
#tr.en: before Awīl-adad, scribe of the Šamaš's nadītus;

20. [_igi_ lu-sza]-lim-be-li2 tap-pu-szu
#tr.ts: maḫar lū-šalim-bēlī tappûšu
#tr.en: before Lū-šalim-bēlī, his colleague.

21. [_igi_ ...]-ba-ni _igi_ i-bi-{d}nin-szubur
#tr.ts: maḫar ...-bānī maḫar i(b)bi-ilabrat
#tr.en: Before ...; before Ibbi-ilabrat,

22. [... _i3]-du8# ka2 ga2-gi4-a{ki}_
# cf. P366185 rev. 43: {d}iszkur-ma-an-szum2 dumu ARAD-i3-li2-szu i3-du8 ka2 ga-gi-a
#tr.ts: ... atîm bāb gagîm
#tr.en: ... doorkeeper at the cloister's gate.

23. [_iti sze-sag11]-ku5 u4 2(u) 5(disz)-kam_
#tr.ts: waraḫ addarim ūmam ešrā u ḫamšat
#tr.en: The month of Addarum, the day 25,

24. [_mu_ sa]-am-su-i-lu-na _lugal alan {gesz}tukul sig3-ge#_
#tr.ts: šanat samsu-iluna šarrum ṣalmam kakkam māḫiṣam
#tr.en: the year: "Samsu-iluna the king (made) a statue (representing himself) wielding a weapon."

